            "components": {
              "feasible_carrier": "OptimizationSelection.feasibleCarrier: exact canonical nonempty carrier guard; last-key verdict dictionary; exact key-set equality; order-preserving true-verdict filter. verdictLastWins, verdictKeysMeaning and feasibleMembership derive original semantics.",
              "undominated": "OptimizationSelection.undominated: nonempty feasible guard and exact pair-endpoint/inequality guard. retainedMembership characterizes all surviving occurrences; eliminatedWitness supplies the retained feasible better candidate. No acyclicity, transitivity or duplicate-free feasible condition added.",
              "exact_optimum": "OptimizationSelection.exactOptimum/classifyOptimum: original errors propagated, unique return exactly when held list is singleton; all other lists, including empty or duplicated lists, retain original class tag and list. classifyUniqueIff proves singleton equivalence.",
              "respects_constraints": "OptimizationSelection.respectsConstraints/constraintsMeaning: every original allowed-set membership; original vacuous truth and repeated constraint-name behavior preserved.",
              "pareto_frontier": "OptimizationBounds.dominatesMeaning, frontierMembership, frontierEliminationWitness, frontierRetainsIncomparable and emptyCriteriaFrontier: original per-criterion all/any conditions, explicit other-not-equal check, complete carrier filter, no extra guards. Duplicate feasible entries and arbitrary relation rows preserved.",
              "exact_approximation": "OptimizationBounds.exactApproximation handles full signed Int domain; original invalid bound/nonpositive optimum guard; positive exact reduced optimum/candidate part. approximationRatio/ThroughOne establish original exact certificate.",
              "SPEC.dimensions": "OptimizationGrammar complete original nine-axis512 product, exact order/IDs/forms/reasons, exhaustive membership/cardinality, criteria equivalence, unique survivor and all coordinate rejection proofs.",
              "SPEC.witnesses": "OptimizationWitnesses all six records use actual translated operations; allWitnessesPass is kernel proved.",
              "SPEC.laws_and_induction": "Native arbitrary finite-list results establish complete retained selection, every elimination witness, singleton uniqueness, incomparability and exact positive approximation. Original base/successor/decomposition statement retained verbatim in closure. Source supplies no separate decomposition operation: its exact shared-interface requirement remains the admitted decomposition coordinate and rejection criterion, relying on the registered Graph/Order dependencies without an invented algorithm.",
              "SPEC.exclusions_and_exposition": "OptimizationControls and OptimizationEvidence retain all original exclusions, why/derivation/check/limitations/correspondence terms. Complexity/objective-family laws remain in their original separate source branches.",
              "generated_law.py program": "OptimizationEvidence and Controls preserve original registration,512 generated records, actual lookup decisions, closure/generality/control digest payloads and original StopIteration refusal; every output compared against pinned artifacts."
